WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:05.299
There’s a new Game of Thrones Season 7 promo
out now called Long Walk.

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:07.490
Let’s have a quick look.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:13.670
So the promo focusses on three main characters
– Jon Snow, Daenerys Targaryen and Cersei

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:19.150
Lannister, who each walk and take their place
at their respective seats of power – Jon

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.779
as King in the North in Winterfell, Cersei
as Queen of Westeros on the Iron Throne, and

00:00:24.779 --> 00:00:30.859
Dany at her seat on the island of Dragonstone
– from there she hopes to invade and conquer

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:32.870
Westeros.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:39.110
Dragonstone has a lot of history and symbolism
for Dany and her family, the Targaryens.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:47.160
Dany was born at Dragonstone, and centuries
before, her great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-grandfather

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:51.969
Aegon the Conqueror left from Dragonstone
to take Westeros and establish the Targaryen

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:54.620
dynasty – go watch that video.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.699
So Dany is walking in the footsteps of her
ancient ancestor, it’s by the right of Aegon’s

00:01:00.699 --> 00:01:05.740
conquest that Dany means to claim her crown
– though Cersei might have something to

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.220
say about that.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:13.090
Cersei has walked too, she’s been shamed
and beaten down for her crimes, but this seems

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:17.770
to have only made her angrier, crueller, more
dangerous.

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:23.290
After the deaths of her three children, Cersei
has nothing to lose but her Throne – so

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.979
she won’t easily let it go.

00:01:25.979 --> 00:01:32.020
Jon Snow is also walking, which is impressive
given the state he was in last season.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:39.040
Jon has experienced death, felt the cold,
and he knows about the real threat to Westeros.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.590
He’ll be using his power as King in the
North to try to convince everyone to stop

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:49.030
with the political squabbling and to focus
on the true enemy – cause when the candles

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:56.899
go out, and the eyes all close, a blue eye
opens, an eye of the white walkers.

00:01:56.899 --> 00:02:01.390
This particular eye looks like it belongs
to a giant – look at the big nose – so

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:05.920
this might be Wun Wun, the giant who died
at the Battle of the Bastards.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:10.379
Looks like he’s been raised as a zombie
to fight for the walkers.

00:02:10.379 --> 00:02:14.730
In the books, all sorts of creatures join
the army of the dead – there’s a zombie

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:20.590
bear, zombie birds , talk of dead things in
the water . It seems that anything that can

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:25.090
die can become an undead servant of the walkers.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:30.450
Some fans speculate we could see a zombie
dragon – George Martin did write a book

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.610
called The Ice Dragon, after all.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:39.629
Point is, the walkers are clearly set up as
the main threat to Westeros this next season.

00:02:39.629 --> 00:02:45.349
So this promo, the Long Walk evokes not only
where the characters are going, but also where

00:02:45.349 --> 00:02:46.349
they’ve been.

00:02:46.349 --> 00:02:51.120
Jon, Dany and Cersei have each come a long
way since Season One.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:56.590
Jon Snow was a know-nothing naïve baby-faced
bastard boy, not so long ago – but soon

00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:00.349
became a battle-hardened leader of the Night’s
Watch.

00:03:00.349 --> 00:03:04.020
He was a corpse for a bit but is now the King
of all the North.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:10.580
Dany was the political pawn of her crazy brother
Viserys, but became the dragon queen of Meereen.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:15.380
She was for a while a Dothraki captive, but
is now a powerful conqueror.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:21.629
Cersei started as a cruel capricious incest
queen, and now she’s, well, she’s about

00:03:21.629 --> 00:03:28.269
the same really, but she certainly is angrier,
and now is the Queen of Westeros.

00:03:28.269 --> 00:03:30.350
These three have all walked a long way.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:36.319
They’ve each been brought low, but are now
more experienced, mature, and powerful than

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:37.319
ever were before.

00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:41.530
This is like the point in a video game where
your character’s fully levelled up, maxed

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:48.410
out, and ready to face the final boss – in
this case white walkers, and winter, and the

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:51.870
night that never ends.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.870
Thanks for watching.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.799
Make sure to subscribe and to turn on post
notifications so you don’t miss a video

00:03:56.799 --> 00:03:59.250
– just press that bell button.

